{"slug":"hh-s-b","ar":"ح س ب","total":109,"core":"reckoning; thinking; sufficiency","forms":[{"ar":"حَسِبَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":44,"gloss":"to think, reckon","word":null,"ex":{"s":104,"a":3,"p":1,"ar":["يَحْسَبُ","أَنَّ","مَالَهُۥٓ","أَخْلَدَهُۥ"],"en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal"}},{"ar":"حِسَاب","kind":"verbal noun","form":3,"count":39,"gloss":"The Reckoning","word":"al-hisab","ex":{"s":69,"a":26,"p":4,"ar":["وَلَمْ","أَدْرِ","مَا","حِسَابِيَهْ"],"en":"And had not known what is my account"}},{"ar":"حَسْب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":11,"gloss":"sufficient, enough","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":64,"p":3,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","حَسْبُكَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَنِ","ٱتَّبَعَكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"en":"O Prophet, sufficient for you is Allah and for whoever follows you of the believers"}},{"ar":"حَسِيب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"The Reckoner","word":"al-hasib","ex":{"s":17,"a":14,"p":7,"ar":["ٱقْرَأْ","كِتَـٰبَكَ","كَفَىٰ","بِنَفْسِكَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","عَلَيْكَ","حَسِيبًا"],"en":"[It will be said], \"Read your record. Sufficient is yourself against you this Day as accountant"}},{"ar":"حَاسَبْ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":3,"gloss":"to call to account","word":null,"ex":{"s":84,"a":8,"p":2,"ar":["فَسَوْفَ","يُحَاسَبُ","حِسَابًا","يَسِيرًا"],"en":"He will be judged with an easy account"}},{"ar":"حُسْبَان","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"calculation; calamity","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":5,"p":3,"ar":["ٱلشَّمْسُ","وَٱلْقَمَرُ","بِحُسْبَانٍ"],"en":"The sun and the moon [move] by precise calculation"}},{"ar":"يَحْتَسِبُ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":3,"gloss":"to expect, reckon","word":null,"ex":{"s":65,"a":3,"p":5,"ar":["وَيَرْزُقْهُ","مِنْ","حَيْثُ","لَا","يَحْتَسِبُ ۚ","وَمَن","يَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَهُوَ","حَسْبُهُۥٓ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","بَـٰلِغُ","أَمْرِهِۦ ۚ","قَدْ","جَعَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","لِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدْرًا"],"en":"And will provide for him from where he does not expect. And whoever relies upon Allah - then He is sufficient for him. Indeed, Allah will accomplish His purpose. Allah has already set for everything a [decreed] extent"}},{"ar":"حَٰسِبِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"reckoners","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":62,"p":12,"ar":["ثُمَّ","رُدُّوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","مَوْلَىٰهُمُ","ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","أَلَا","لَهُ","ٱلْحُكْمُ","وَهُوَ","أَسْرَعُ","ٱلْحَـٰسِبِينَ"],"en":"Then they His servants are returned to Allah, their true Lord. Unquestionably, His is the judgement, and He is the swiftest of accountants"}}],"surahs":[[3,12],[24,7],[2,6],[6,5],[18,5],[9,4],[13,4],[14,4],[38,4],[65,4],[5,3],[8,3],[23,3],[39,3],[40,3],[4,2],[17,2],[21,2],[27,2],[29,2],[33,2],[43,2],[58,2],[59,2],[69,2],[75,2],[78,2],[84,2],[90,2],[7,1],[10,1],[25,1],[26,1],[45,1],[47,1],[55,1],[63,1],[76,1],[88,1],[104,1]]}